Status: PERPETUAL
Milestone: Maintain a causal, public-safe development history
Dependencies: None
Purpose: Explain verified development outcomes and decisions across workstreams.
  This is perpetual history, not an ordinary feature issue.

Tasks:
  [ ] Append meaningful workstream outcomes, failures and supersession as they occur.
  [ ] Keep historical tests, fresh checks, human acceptance and publication distinct.

Acceptance criteria:
  Entries explain action, effect, rationale, mechanism, evidence and limitations.
  No transcripts, private continuity, credentials or actual career records copied.

Completion evidence:
  This perpetual ledger has no final completion or GitHub feature-issue mapping.
  Historical implementation evidence lives in retrospective workstreams 01-07.

